ders to break  bread with others  the idea that all of it is meant to be  shared i think is really beautiful thing  yeah  it also tastes really good  delicious food and distinctly  palestinian flavors made from the heart  what does it mean to you to share it  with the world  makes me happy i'm inside i'm this big  mama that want to feed everyone  for cbs saturday morning infyas tayab  london  the big mama that wants to feed everyone  oh my god who's hungry i'm starving  i'm thirsty right i've gotta try the  hummus we have a toast after the show to  celebrate our new we gotta have us well  we gotta have drinks on a saturday and  homeless too we can have whatever you  want whatever you want don't worry

